IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `dg-core`

-- Delaware General Corporation Law, 8 Del. C. ch. 1, Subchapter IX, sections 263 to 268 (piece dg8).
-- dg8-nouns: the one noun that sections 263 and 264 share, and four small predicates over it.
--
-- The source is the plain-text rendering de-code-t8-ch1-2026-10-01.txt of the Delaware Code Online,
-- made by a converter script; it is not the official text and nothing here is verified against the official text.
-- Quote lines below are slices of that file: `-- src:N | ...` is line N, and an ellipsis means the line goes on.
--
-- SEAT: a person who incorporates, directs or holds stock in a Delaware corporation
-- (an incorporator, a director or officer, a stockholder including a minority stockholder).
--
-- Sections 263 and 264 are twins with differences (the extra approval by a stockholder who becomes a
-- general partner in section 263(c); "type of entity" in 263(c)(1); who signs the certificate; partners and members).
-- Each is encoded in its own module, from its own lines. Only the form of the combination is common to both.

§ `The forms of a combination`

-- src:1278 | Such corporation or corporations and such 1 or more partnerships may merge with or into a surviving corporation, which may be any 1 of such corporations, or they may merge with or into a surviving partnership, which may be any 1 of such partnerships, or they may consolidate into a new resulting corporation, which corporation shall be a corporation of this State, or a partnership formed pursuant to an agreement of merger or consolidation, as the case may be, complying and approved in accordance with this section. …
-- src:1303 | Such corporation or corporations and such 1 or more limited liability companies may merge with or into a surviving corporation, which may be any 1 of such corporations, or they may merge with or into a surviving limited liability company, which may be any 1 of such limited liability companies, or they may consolidate into a new resulting corporation, which corporation shall be a corporation of this State, or a limited liability company formed pursuant to an agreement of merger or consolidation, as the case may be, complying and approved in accordance with this section. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 263(a) (src:1278); § 264(a) (src:1303)
-- The four forms the two sections allow. A merger ends in a surviving corporation (any one of the merging corporations,
-- which is a corporation of this State) or in a surviving partnership or company (any one of those); a consolidation
-- ends in a new resulting corporation, which "shall be a corporation of this State", or in a new partnership or company
-- formed by the agreement. The "entity that is not a corporation" is the partnership in section 263 and the limited
-- liability company in section 264; the section's own module says which.
DECLARE `dg8 Form of a combination` IS ONE OF
    `a merger into a surviving corporation of this State`
    `a merger into a surviving entity that is not a corporation`
    `a consolidation into a new resulting corporation of this State`
    `a consolidation into a new resulting entity that is not a corporation`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 263(a) (src:1278); § 264(a) (src:1303)
GIVEN form IS A `dg8 Form of a combination`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`dg8 the combination is a merger into a surviving corporation` form MEANS
    CONSIDER form
    WHEN `a merger into a surviving corporation of this State` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

@ref 8 Del. C. § 263(a) (src:1278); § 264(a) (src:1303)
GIVEN form IS A `dg8 Form of a combination`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`dg8 the combination is a consolidation into a resulting corporation` form MEANS
    CONSIDER form
    WHEN `a consolidation into a new resulting corporation of this State` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

@ref 8 Del. C. § 263(a) (src:1278); § 264(a) (src:1303)
GIVEN form IS A `dg8 Form of a combination`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`dg8 the combination ends in a corporation of this State` form MEANS
        `dg8 the combination is a merger into a surviving corporation` form
    OR  `dg8 the combination is a consolidation into a resulting corporation` form

@ref 8 Del. C. § 263(a) (src:1278); § 264(a) (src:1303)
GIVEN form IS A `dg8 Form of a combination`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`dg8 the combination ends in an entity that is not a corporation` form MEANS
    NOT (`dg8 the combination ends in a corporation of this State` form)
